  "description": "Yoon Baek is a typical young man who works part-time jobs to make a living. One day, he comes across a stray cat that leads him to a veterinarian named Jay Blythe. After realizing that he met him before in his dreams, he comes to learn that he's been selected by Jay to be his next prey. Yoon later finds out that his older brother who went missing a few months back was also eaten by Jay, the tiger, before he lead him to Yoon for the tiger's next meal. In order to escape the curse of the tiger, he must find another sacrifice. But the blurred lines in their relationship makes their fate growingly uncertain. \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS) \n\n*Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
